 2016. We are in the process of planning our destination wedding, with hopes of it being in Punta Cana, DR. We are definitely looking for an all-inclusive that can accommodate a slightly larger group. Any suggestions about resorts or vendors in Punta Cana, including wedding planners, are most welcomed!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1916948,"PostDate":1483484644,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Everyone! My fiance and I got engaged over Thanksgiving weekend 2016. We are in the process of planning our destination wedding, with hopes of it being in Punta Cana, DR. We are definitely looking for an all-inclusive that can accommodate a slightly larger group. Any suggestions about resorts or vendors in Punta Cana, including wedding planners, are most welcomed!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"laurene.anker@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.222.60.226","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1483474888,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"ankerl","Id":288231,"Name":"ankerl","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80880","Title":"Planning A Destination Wedding In Punta Cana In Nov.2017","LastPostDate":1483484644},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
