would like to get married by church. I don&#039;t want to have any big party in NY because is expensive so we thought of destination wedding.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Has anyone done a small church wedding before going to their destination wedding..&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;thank you&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915184,"PostDate":1470435287,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi ladies,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Im already married through civil, but we would like to get married by church. I don't want to have any big party in NY because is expensive so we thought of destination wedding.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Has anyone done a small church wedding before going to their destination wedding..\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>thank you<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"christine.osoria@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.208.77.172","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1373927302,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271565.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"christy531","Id":271565,"Name":"christy531","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80229","Title":"Church Wedding Before Destination Wedding","LastPostDate":1470435287},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
