 We&#039;ve been together over 3 years, I&#039;m 26 &amp; he&#039;s 28. We&#039;ve been talking about marriage a lot, and what we want for our lives together. On last Friday night he surprised me with tickets to the zoo in our city, and we walked around for hours just gazing at the beautiful light-show. Towards the end of the night, we sat on a bench, and he said he had a present for me. I truly did not think it would be a ring!\n\n He got down on one knee and pulled out a metal oyster that he had made (!) with a pearl ring in it just like I&#039;ve always wanted. Not traditional,but gorgeous.\n\n And now i am basking in the newly engaged glow....I am so exciting and begin to choose my wedding dress. I want something simple, something dressy. I took a fancy to a strapless wedding dress and planning to wear it with a lace shrug. \n\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.dudool.com\/images\/\/weddingdress091_\/Wedding-Dresses\/2011-Alluring-Pleated-A-line-Empire-Waist-Beads.jpg\" width=\"320\" height=\"480\"&gt;\n\n But my best friend suggested me to choose another iridescent satin wedding.\n\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.dudool.com\/images\/\/cloth002_\/Wedding-amp-Special\/Fabulous-White-Iridescent-Satin-Off-the-Shoulder-6.JPG\" width=\"320\" height=\"480\"&gt;\n\n I am entangled with the choice. Please give me some advice. Thank you!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1756483,"PostDate":1368182437,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We're engaged!! Hello ladies!<br><br><br> We just got engaged last weekend, and I'm so excited!! We've been together over 3 years, I'm 26 & he's 28. We've been talking about marriage a lot, and what we want for our lives together. On last Friday night he surprised me with tickets to the zoo in our city, and we walked around for hours just gazing at the beautiful light-show. Towards the end of the night, we sat on a bench, and he said he had a present for me. I truly did not think it would be a ring!<br><br> He got down on one knee and pulled out a metal oyster that he had made (!) with a pearl ring in it just like I've always wanted. Not traditional,but gorgeous.<br><br> And now i am basking in the newly engaged glow....I am so exciting and begin to choose my wedding dress. I want something simple, something dressy. I took a fancy to a strapless wedding dress and planning to wear it with a lace shrug. <br><br> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.dudool.com\/images\/\/weddingdress091_\/Wedding-Dresses\/2011-Alluring-Pleated-A-line-Empire-Waist-Beads.jpg\" width=\"320\" height=\"480\"><\/span><br><br> But my best friend suggested me to choose another iridescent satin wedding.<br><br> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.dudool.com\/images\/\/cloth002_\/Wedding-amp-Special\/Fabulous-White-Iridescent-Satin-Off-the-Shoulder-6.JPG\" width=\"320\" height=\"480\"><\/span><br><br> I am entangled with the choice. Please give me some advice. Thank you!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stacymkpv@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1360141846,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"hinton10","Id":265724,"Name":"hinton10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.203.131.25","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73881,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6a6c66b03ef04fd20da3b6aad7f65e06","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats on your engagement.&amp;nbsp; I also got engaged on a bench at the zoo&amp;nbsp; :)&amp;nbsp; Ours was during a Christmas Light display.&amp;nbsp;\n\n\nI think both dresses are stunning.&amp;nbsp; It would really depend on which looks better on you.&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;I just realized you posted in May though.&amp;nbsp; By now I am sure you already made up your mind.&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1829700,"PostDate":1391018951,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats on your engagement.\u00a0 I also got engaged on a bench at the zoo\u00a0 <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 Ours was during a Christmas Light display.\u00a0<br><br>\nI think both dresses are stunning.\u00a0 It would really depend on which looks better on you.\u00a0 <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<br \/><p>I just realized you posted in May though.\u00a0 By now I am sure you already made up your mind.\u00a0 <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janetanddan2014@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.203.131.25","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1359746552,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"JanetandDan2014","Id":265502,"Name":"JanetandDan2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.82.123.139","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73881,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c3a951fdce8c01a4dcd29e041bf52dd6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats on your engagement.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1916487,"PostDate":1476774457,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats on your engagement.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicolejbarbieri@outlook.com","IpAddress":"208.82.123.139","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1476773936,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287910.jpg?_r=1476774953","PhotoWidth":194,"PhotoHeight":260,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"margery","Id":287910,"Name":"margery","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"73881","Title":"We're engaged!!","LastPostDate":1476774457},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0